	(text "Header pins: 1 IO (330 R in series against shorts and hot-plugging),\n2 VCC (5 V from the buck), 3 GND.\nIO1-IO4 = GPIO22-25 (5 V tolerant).\nIO5/IO6 = GPIO26/27 (ADC0/1): 3.3 V logic only.\nServos: drive them from the third PIO block, since GPIO22-27\nshare PWM slices 3-5 with the motors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
